"Wave Speed on a String - Tension Force, Intensity, Power, Amplitude, Frequency - Inverse Square Law",https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vEzftaDL7fM,"Explains wave speed on a stretched string, wave intensity and the inverse-square law, and relationships among tension, linear density, period, frequency, wavelength, amplitude, power, and distance."
"Standing Waves on a String, Fundamental Frequency, Harmonics, Overtones, Nodes, Antinodes, Physics",https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-8nn8hb0H8o,"Explains standing waves on strings and calculates wavelengths, fundamental frequencies, harmonics, and overtones while identifying nodes and antinodes."
